      "text": "**Migrate inline source comments to `TODO:` / `FIXME:` / `BUG:` tags: Today, many source files use `// TODO`, `// FIXME`, or prose like \"needs investigation\" without the canonical prefix. Sweep `src/` and normalize so TodoScope picks them up as cards. `NOTE:` is documentation, not a work item \u2014 leave those alone.**\n`TODO.md:L389`",
