    {
      "file_path": "TODO.md",
      "height": 80,
      "id": "920015fb4ceb5265",
      "line_num": 95,
      "source": "todo_md",
      "tags": [],
      "text": "**Inset shadows don't play well with other shadows \u2014 When combining `--shadow-inset` with `--shadow` or `--shadow-hvr`, the rendering breaks or produces unexpected results. Discovered while building the sage.is/hardware configurator page. Needs investigation into how the CSS custom property shadow system composes inset and standard box-shadows together.**\n`TODO.md:L95`",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 280,
      "x": 1060,
      "y": 60
    },
